{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_09_end","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_09","title":"文明的謊言","storyCode":"IS-9","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_09_end.txt","sourceHash":"8c3b0c8ae61b94c393f59287b9e75236a2278f6cd2a590912235574e4285d432","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"次級核心區分離在即，舊時代的人們把希望寄託在下一代身上。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖——結果還是讓他走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在中途就已經不想跟我們打了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道沒有感覺嗎，他如果真的想殺了我們，也只是時間問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是不想浪費那個時間而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別小看任何一個敘拉古家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你搞錯了一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從沒小看過任何一個敘拉古家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認真地把每一個家族都視作我的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"包括貝洛內在內。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會不會有點太著急了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來你也不怎麼驚訝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你會背叛你的領袖，我又怎麼能相信你會誠心和我們結盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我必須提醒你，現在確實不是時候。"},{"type":"narration","text":"面對瓦拉赫的利刃，德米特里卻沒有絲毫動搖，反而將頭轉向身邊的手下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城內的狀況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有家族都已經知道次級核心區分離程式的啟動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝洛內和薩盧佐已經成為眾矢之的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在剛才，其他家族的成員也對我們發動了攻擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我讓你重點關注的事情呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您猜得沒錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從我們安插在其他家族的楔子傳回來的情報看，雖然貝洛內和薩盧佐成為眾矢之的，但這並不是他們關注的重點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今城內的混亂，對所有家族來說，都是求之不得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被西西里夫人壓制許久的積怨，正在不斷爆發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以瓜分貝洛內和薩盧佐這兩塊蛋糕為由頭爆發的衝突，乃至單純想要借此一雪前恥的家族恩怨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的家族都或主動或被動地捲了進來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）......首領，這就是你想要的結果，是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）你果然，背叛了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦拉赫，你不是個蠢貨，你應該能明白，我們現在在這裡衝突沒有任何好處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先解決掉一個大麻煩，難道不算好處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅塞蒂在哥倫比亞難道就一呼百應？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的妄想僅靠你們自己就吞下整個敘拉古？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好選擇自己的盟友，瓦拉赫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別難過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是形勢所迫，我也不是很想和你結盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，他沒有回家族嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，並且我們沒有找到少爺的蹤跡，他顯然是有意避開了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂，你難道也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"德米特里深吸了一口氣。\n此時此刻，多想無益，他必須面對當下的現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然所有家族都開始了互相撕咬，那麼，眼下，就是我們奪取次級核心區的最佳時機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有先控制住了那裡，我們才有未來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧佐家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧佐家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很混亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧佐家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有許多家族的人在趁亂進攻我們，而我們下面的人也開始了反擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧佐家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"局勢已經一發不可收拾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真有意思，這不可能是萊昂圖索那個小崽子的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在想來，貝納爾多，雖然拉普蘭德只是一時起意，但你在那時就把我們薩盧佐也算計進去了，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西西里定下的鐵則搖搖欲墜，這幾十年來敘拉古之所以是敘拉古的根基被你一把火點燃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你想要看到的？為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普蘭德呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧佐家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從昨天開始，就聯絡不上她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......罷了，罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧佐家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領，現在城裡局勢一片混亂，我們還要繼續靜觀其變嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，現在，就算薩盧佐想要置身事外，也不可能做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多那個老東西，連這一步都算到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓外面的人都回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，派一部分精銳去次級核心區的指揮塔，貝洛內和羅塞蒂，不會放過那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧佐家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是指——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對那座新城市沒有興趣，但背叛我的人也休想得到它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g6_laterano_chapelin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂......沒想到你能找到這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只是憑著記憶找到這裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然來了，就坐一坐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親，我已經理解了你的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你理解了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從一開始，你想要看到的，就是讓敘拉古回到六十年前的黑暗時期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族之間互相撕咬，如果不是西西里夫人介入，恐怕敘拉古的家族在那時就會死傷慘重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次，你想讓他們擺脫西西里夫人設下的桎梏，互相咬得更加慘烈，直到家族不復存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......看起來，你確實瞭解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你應當不是來向我證明你的猜測的，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只想知道，究竟是什麼讓你產生了這種想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我二十歲的時候，我還是貝洛內家族的一個普通成員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在一次刺殺中，我失敗了，被迫逃到附近的村莊裡，改頭換面躲藏了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在那裡生活了將近半年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這半年裡，值得一提的事情並沒有多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這半年的生活本身，讓我對我所處的國家產生了全新的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古沒有一個角落和家族無關，但在城市周邊村莊這樣的地方，所謂的家族，事實上做的事和普通村民惡霸沒有什麼區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找了一份鞋匠的工作，在那個夏天，我在那條街上一邊工作，一邊觀察著仇家的動向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後，仇家的動向並沒有值得一提的地方，反倒是那個在街邊揮汗如雨的夏天，令我終生難忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂，你也好，我也好，自家族出身的人，天然就被打上了烙印。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但就在那個夏天，我意識到了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古沒有家族，依然可以運轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你才會幫助拉維妮婭，所以，你才會不干涉我和拉維妮婭越走越近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是真心想要支持她的理想的，是嗎，父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實想要看一看，她所構想的公平，究竟是一種怎樣的公平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你才沒有給這個計劃上保險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不需要我、拉維妮婭，或者任何人為這個計劃承擔風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你相信，當你為普通人掃平名為家族的障礙之後，他們的生活不會有任何負面影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誠然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是，這樣是不夠的，父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不夠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，遠遠不夠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i12"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓家族之間互相撕咬，直到他們消耗殆盡，這樣或許確實能夠將現有的家族體系推翻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，敘拉古並不會因此而被交到普通人手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你擔心西西里夫人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我擔心的是一種慣性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在作為卡拉奇的助手工作的過程中，逐漸意識到了一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族在這片土地上扎根了千百年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們即使對家族有所排斥，卻也不知道除此之外，敘拉古能變成何種姿態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，將之推翻之後，他們能夠創造出新的東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們會不知所措，因為他們不知道發生了什麼，他們只知道原本的屋子忽然化為了廢墟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是，當他們想要在廢墟上重建時，又會建造出名為家族的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一切不會有任何改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親，現在這樣下去，我們或許能短暫地獲得一個沒有家族的敘拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你夢想中的敘拉古，卻絕不會到來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的想法太傲慢了，父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想將你想像中的敘拉古施捨給他們，卻沒想過，他們願不願意，以及能不能夠接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只能讓生活在這片土地上的每一個人都知道，正在發生什麼，我們必須讓他們也參與到這個過程中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣，我們才能夠在最後去討論，我們該如何構建一個“沒有家族的敘拉古”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g6_laterano_chapelin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，我的兒子確實長大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以為，你找到我，最多不過是一場父子之爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卻沒想到，由你給我上了一課。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會去找拉維妮婭，組織一些家族以外的有生力量，在這片混亂中奪取次級核心區的指揮塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要新城市這張牌在我的手上，至少不至於太過被動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於在那之後，是和西西里夫人談判，還是直接對抗西西里夫人，我也只能走一步，看一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，無論如何，父親，我們都將背叛德米特，背叛我們的家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就按你的想法去做吧，萊昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親，這場風波由你而起，你可別想一句交給我了，就置身事外了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......放心，我會趕上你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尊敬的阿格尼爾，我聽說，你從不踏足教堂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古不需要教堂。然而，我們接受了一部分拉特蘭的思想，就註定要受其文化的影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最終，我也只能選擇讓自己遠離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，為你這樣的人物破一次例，也算值得。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g3_srccourt"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下，人都在這裡了，五十多個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些被家族安插進來的傢伙，都回到自己所屬的家族去了，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，雖然很諷刺，卻也省了一些麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法院，在敘拉古處於一個十分尷尬的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在一定程度上代表著西西里夫人的意志，並因此獲得了一定的權力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這份權力並不能讓我們很好地履行我們的義務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相反，我們獲得的權力，在很多時候，只會讓我們更深刻地認識到，面對家族這個概念，我們是多麼地無能為力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們既不能像大多數普通民眾那樣，逆來順受，也無法真正融入那些家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這個過程中，我們的許多同伴都因無法忍受這樣的環境而被異化、驅逐，甚至殘害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，即使他們最終背叛了自己的這份職業，我也沒有任何立場去指責他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，我也只不過是因為有著貝洛內家族的背景，才能夠在這條道路上走到今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天發生的事情，以及外面正在發生的事情，想必你們都知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本以為，我能做的只有像過往一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祈禱著家族的鬥爭不會把太多普通人捲入其中，祈禱著最後會有西西里夫人來為我們“主持正義”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，有一個勇敢的人，告訴我們，他覺得家族是邪惡的，他覺得這一切是不公的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他想要改變這一切，而他，將希望寄託給了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都和我一樣，來自家族以外的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們與我共事了這麼多年，我相信你們之中，比我對家族更加不滿，比我對現狀有更深刻理解的人比比皆是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我想請各位助我一臂之力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一陣沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能做到什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在不久之前，新城市核心區的分離程式被啟動了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這坐實了盧比奧部長揭露的，貝洛內家族和薩盧佐家族的陰謀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這對家族來說，是點燃他們鬥爭的火焰，而對我們來說，同樣是一個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新的移動城市，會成為我們在這場混亂之中的籌碼，無論是之後與西西里夫人談判，或者是與家族角力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"又一陣沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就算把我們所有人加在一起，也太少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有兩個可靠的朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是切利尼娜？！為什麼你會——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我怎麼沒聽說過沃爾西尼還有別的薩科塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們只需要知道，切利尼娜和她的朋友會站在我們這一邊就足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，盧比奧部長給我留下了一些幫手，我聯絡到了他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們會為我們提供幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我必須對各位誠實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一條荊棘之路，我無法保證每個人都能活下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想為此冒生命危險的，可以離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算成功了，我們真的就能做到什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我唯一能向各位許諾的是，我願意為此付出生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"還剩下三十多人。\n但他們沒有離開的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是我感謝你給我這個機會，閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有你在這座法院裡，我恐怕早就被逼瘋了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅定的法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廣播我也聽了，我能猜到發生了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅定的法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實在的，我也忍不下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的法庭護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我們什麼都做不到，但我至少要讓那些家族知道，我們不是任他們宰割的鱗肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝各位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敘拉古官員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭小姐，我這邊準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敘拉古官員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，現在，各個家族都亂成了一鍋粥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敘拉古官員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們平時就根本不把我們這些人放在眼裡，現在，他們更想不到，我們居然會在這種時候給他們使絆子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敘拉古官員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我們就是要讓他們知道，他們從沒有真正參與過城市的運轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敘拉古官員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市，是掌握在我們手上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敘拉古官員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你和你的人，儘管往指揮塔去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敘拉古官員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們會利用各種手段，幫你們盡可能阻攔那些家族的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，你們也要量力而行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敘拉古官員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"該說謝謝的是我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敘拉古官員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有正面抗衡家族的力量，結果還是把最危險的事情交給你來做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我心甘情願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敘拉古官員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就祝彼此好運吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，祝彼此好運吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g6_laterano_chapelin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以卡拉奇為餌，將自己的兒子也算計其中不說，甚至以對付西西里的大義，騙過了自己的手下，只為將城裡的水攪渾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使薩盧佐家那頭離群的小狼插手，你也沒有絲毫動搖，反而是借此將薩盧佐拖下水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高調地刺殺羅塞蒂家族的小丫頭，一方面是要阿爾貝托放心與你同盟，一方面，卻也是做給其他家族看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後的德克薩斯這張牌，也得到了充分的利用，羅塞蒂在喬萬娜手上是一把藏鋒於鞘中的利劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在瓦拉赫手中，卻是鋒芒畢露的凶刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧比奧與卡拉奇的聯繫被你看在眼裡，甚至他的憤怒都被你利用，他以為他的隱忍無人知曉，卻不曾想早已被你探知到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道你會在城裡，卻沒想到，我的佈局，全都被看穿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得知結果之後，再去反推其中過程，總是要簡單一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"況且，大勢已成，就算我反推出了這一切，也已經無能為力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至，哪怕西西里現在立刻出現在這座城市中，她也會感到棘手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰又能想得到，最為強盛的家族的領袖，卻以自己的家族為餌，想要讓所有的家族為之陪葬呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來並不惱怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西西里向我尋求的，從來都不是一個永遠繁榮的敘拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我在這片土地上尋求的，也從來不是權力，或者財富。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的做法毫無疑問破壞了西西里制定的規矩，所以，我確實是為了了結你而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我沒想到，居然收穫了一場意料之外的父子之談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西西里不接受破壞規則，是因為，從來沒有人提出能讓她滿意的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，你有一個優秀的兒子，貝納爾多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僅憑你，是無法撼動西西里親手打造的這個時代的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果是你與你的兒子，那麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未嘗不可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dia