vg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年，西西里夫人自拉特蘭回來時，她作何感想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她為自己即將面臨的挑戰感到忐忑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她為自己即將開創的時代感到期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與你此時此刻的感受一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，嗯，我知道了，你們那邊也小心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯和能天使還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，她們現在和拉維妮婭小姐在一起，說是打算幫她的忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個法官小姐嗎，聽起來至少要比之前的那個貝洛內家族要可靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願她們不會出事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"喬萬娜小姐，你、你醒了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒......死嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，對方出手的位置偏離了你心臟幾釐米，所以你活了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，也多虧了你的身體素質好......不然，恐怕還是撐不下來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦拉赫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我昏迷多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一天，城裡應該發生了許多事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我說說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g6_laterano_chapelin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你終於來了，吾主，不，扎羅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟在謀劃些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你並不是愚蠢的存在，你只是不願意相信自己得出的結論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼敢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有何不敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你教了我一輩子的權力與背叛，你是如此地傲慢與自信，以至於，你從來都沒有想過，有一天，我也會背叛你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多，不要忘了，你的一切，都是我給你的！"},{"type":"narration","text":"漆黑的霧氣纏繞住了貝納爾多的脖子。\n但他卻毫不在意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i13"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你還不明白嗎，扎羅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"狼之主之間的遊戲，對我來說不值一哂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而對你來說，你所能想像的極限，是敘拉古這個國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你認為權力的極致，是掌控一個國家，或者更多國家，乃至奴役整片大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我並不這麼認為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真正的權力，應當是能夠引領一整個時代的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原本，在我的計劃中，敘拉古將為我而傾倒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我的孩子告訴我，他所見到的宏圖更為廣闊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你應當為此感到欣慰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然後，抱著這份欣慰回到你的山林中去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這一輪的遊戲——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你輸......了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我輸了？哼，我有無數種方法——"},{"type":"narration","text":"狼之主有太多控制獠牙的方法。\n然而，扎羅馬上發現，一絲鮮血從貝納爾多的嘴角流下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毒藥？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從一開始，就準備好這麼做了是嗎，貝納爾多！"},{"type":"narration","text":"貝納爾多沒有回答，他已經沒有力氣開口了。\n他只是抬起頭，順著教堂虛掩的門看去。\n他的視線穿過花圃，高樓，陰雲。\n最後穿過時光。\n他看到了那一年的夏天，他作為一個鞋匠，在烈日下揮汗如雨。\n但他卻從中感到了前所未有的充實。\n此後一生，這種感覺都縈繞在他的心頭。\n他緩緩閉上了雙眼。\n像一個君王。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愚不可及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愚不可及！！！"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨狼的咆哮響徹整個教堂。\n然而，沒有人回應他。\n片刻之後，他將視線轉向萊昂圖索離開的方向。\n他不接受這樣的失敗。\n絕不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g1_srcstreet"},{"type":"narration","text":"沃爾西尼的街道上，或上演著家族之間的鬥爭，或空空如也。\n沒有人察覺到，在沃爾西尼的入口，緩緩走來了一位老婦人。\n而在不遠處，一位戴著眼罩的薩科塔，正安靜地等待著她的到來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和藹的老婦人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從這裡已經能看到新城區的建築群了嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，還挺壯觀的，不是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和藹的老婦人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，從我的角度來說，棱角有些太過銳利了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，你的品味落後於時代了啊，西西里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又能好得到哪裡去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你決定了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先去警告一下，那幾個動作最大的家族吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨著西西里夫人話音落下，在她身後不遠處，有幾道黑影竄出。\n而後迅速消失在沃爾西尼林立的建築之間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，我要去見一見我的老朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的意見還不夠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意見總是越多越好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你果然在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是阿格尼爾告訴你我在這裡的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這家餐廳做的菜，我很喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，西西里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是來做什麼的，西西里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只是單純的鎮壓城內的混亂，你恐怕不會來找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多瞭解狼群，他的計劃歸根結底，不過是順勢而為四個字而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十二家族的血性已經被他挑動起來了，想要撲滅這種血性，沒有那麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......卻也沒有那麼困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我從阿格尼爾那裡，聽說了一些別的東西，我想聽聽你這個老朋友的建議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有什麼想法，只不過是常吃的餐廳，想要換一個主廚，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為，你多少也會對如今的敘拉古有些感情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懷念也是一種情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是個薄情的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的需要我的意見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我很想知道，你，一個誕生於文明，卻自疏於文明之人的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......每個時代的人，總會被自己所誕生的時代束縛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人倖免。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多的想法，是你所屬的時代誕生的執念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只能想到用暴力去拆解，卻無以為繼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他兒子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法評價，畢竟我不能預知未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你也清楚，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是誕生於這個時代的萌芽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]}]}
